type: software
title: "Ellipsoid fitting in Rocq"
abstract: >-
  Rocq proofs, checked by the kernel, of the sharp threshold for random
  ellipsoid fitting and of new results on optimal conditioning, mixtures,
  dependent laws and translated samples, with the reusable library
  GaussianAnalysis.
